ia direct URLs:\\n* **URL Upload Bot (`@uploadbot`)** �?\" Lets you upload files to or from the cloud using a direct URL[4].\\n* **Linkgram (`@LinkgramBot`)** �?\" Converts direct links to Telegram files and handles media utility tasks[4].\\n\\n---\\n\\n### How to Use Them Effectively:\\n1. Open Telegram and search for the bot username (e.g., `@linkgenerator_dl_bot`)[2].\\n2. Press **Start**[2].\\n3. Forward the target file, video, or document from any accessible/public channel straight to the bot chat[2].\\n4. The bot will reply almost instantly with a **Direct Download Link** and sometimes a **Stream Link** which you can open in any web browser or paste into a download manager for maximum speed[3][2]. \\n\\n*Note: Free public bots can occasionally experience heavy traffic slowdowns or periodic downtime due to Telegram API limits. If you manage large files regularly, developers often deploy their own private instances using open-source GitHub repositories (like `FileToLink` or `file2url`)[3][5].*\\n\\nSources:\\n[1] [telegramic.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGrCQzFTtJqwazXBieWMLHndHfONUfAhpN_QLcjfmywFTxq0z6Yqh0QkHYTID7YYy7vB53sfxw4sNJr-gwBhsu8xot5z1ySyCWnwuFJ0u9QSUeCBzsGNt9_XVWTiVMktwYjbx6sxZ8=)\\n[2] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFPjYunaLtYJxytDXAdcEJHq2IN5YWLXg7UB8Fsh5g3VESG7uh3Xe-IGqJNIx_ZxqMYw8L3D0SYsFxgyDCtRUPIuvlmy-1i-pUKp0EfUNL2Nj8bvqXQ_rh82eTrbIyOZxFv)\\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH4DIbn0OH0ctYhSBQKeKu2QGKaRo-MFnXxxmDvSzATSSfVuXgHd1ACBZ7qvvIQQ6H26OxZCDb9aqsXC1cXOGGDdKM_ypZYtT84R6AlypwvWwVwrlLHXTprBbs150LnVNM=)\\n[4] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG3Z56jyAJeaRv0H23ZH2iNtqRGb1P1s5NL2Vng3B97GC4VhFHYxuKPVUkvuVKlOdlnvJ5uggbR10zS33fESm5HXimKKRvpk6oV21q94KEc3-mz0tU5S57OZ3UwG3DfD6EpjjiWrEEUEmGXO3eQoLA12YBUkCDYGAaUzm3RXkyU5w==)\\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearc